{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act52side_level_act52side_02_end","storyGroup":"act52side","storySort":5,"storyDependence":"act52side_level_act52side_02_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"YW-2","storyName":"浮浮沉沉","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"招摇撞骗的假贵族德·托莱多在同伴瓦列里奥的推荐下进入船厂工作。阿奎拉在人群中进行非法交易被德鲁莎逮捕。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act52side/level_act52side_02_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act52side_02_end","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":3,"next":5,"characters":["洒脱的船工","特菲","萨尔瓦多","南多","瓦列里奥","？？？","斐戴拉","制帆匠","谨慎的岛民","阿奎拉","德鲁莎","惩戒军士官","纳乔","塔西塔"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_bg_74_g3_seasidest_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2275_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"洒脱的船工","text":"天，你不是在广场跟审判庭对着干的那个姑娘吗，怎么到船厂门口来了？埃娅，科隆·德，托多……叫什么来着？","id":11,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":12},{"type":"charslot","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"是埃斯特菲尼娅·科隆·德·托莱多！","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2275_1#1$1","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"洒脱的船工","text":"这几天在哪儿都能见到你，到处宣讲黄金时代的故事，难道你真的是王室海军的后裔？","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#4$1","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"那还有假——","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":21},{"type":"charslot","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2274_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":23},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔瓦多","text":"伊比利亚所有的贵族和我们的黄金时代都已经死去，每一位教士、每一部经书都这么说。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2275_1#1$1","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"洒脱的船工","text":"萨尔瓦多……","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#1$1","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"既然你认为它们已经死去，现在又为什么站在这里，参与打捞呢？","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2274_1#1$1","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔瓦多","text":"“圣徒在上，我愿遵循伊比利亚美德的化身的指引。”","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔瓦多","text":"“祈祷诸位能驱使审判的灯火，洗涤我们的戴罪之身，祛除因罪而滋生的孽物。”","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔瓦多","text":"我该为接触你等罪孽的化身感到羞耻，我的盐呢……我该警醒自己……","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#8$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"所以你对我们充满荣光的过去，甚至对雷亚-伊比利亚长什么样子都没有期待吗？","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#13$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"何其可悲，你老家的教士到底叫你抄了多少遍经？审判庭的经书本就——","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":38},{"type":"charslot","id":39},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#8$1","duration":"0.5","id":41},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"等等再跟他们攀谈吧，审判庭调查，麻烦跟我走一趟。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loading_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_sys_loading_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":44,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#15$1","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"是你？启动仪式当天你就拦我，怎么今天又找到我头上！","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#8$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"满口谎言，煽动群众……我怀疑你另有所图，但这里是港都外围城区，我不会直接逮捕你，只希望你能配合接受身份调查。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"charslot","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"长官，请等一等……","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"我想您看得出来，装作贵族只是因为她想谋财，那些黄金时代的故事也只是为了吸引眼球而夸大其词……","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#1$1","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"如果她真如你所说只是谋财，不曾与异端勾结，只要受讯结束就能被释放。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"请谅解，一切为了伊比利亚的洁净与德行。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"可你维护它们的方式并不是审判庭所期许的，南多·加西亚·鲁比奥。","id":59},{"type":"dialog","id":60},{"type":"charslot","id":61},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fsmummy","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":62},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"1.5","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#10$1","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"斐戴拉大审判官？","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"为什么在船厂门前生事？你的教官是谁，巡逻组的工作需要我再重复一遍吗？","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#11$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"与德鲁莎教官无关，是我自己发现了异常，想进一步追查。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"调查批文呢？","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#11$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"没有……","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"连巧立名目都不会，该说你是诚实还是愚钝。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"抬起头，士兵，回到你的岗位上去。我不会捆住你的手脚，但下次行动前，你需要好好想清楚，自己究竟是为何行动。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#7$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"是……","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":81},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","loop":"true","channel":"4","id":82},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"4","fadetime":"1","id":83},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":84},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":85},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":87},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fsmummy","loop":"true","channel":"5","id":88},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"5","fadetime":"1.5","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":91},{"type":"charslot","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":93},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":94},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","loop":"true","channel":"r","id":95},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"r","fadetime":"1","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":97},{"type":"dialog","id":98},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":99},{"type":"charslot","id":100},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":101},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_bg_74_g8_shipatelier.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":102},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":103},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"刚刚多谢您，大审判官阁下。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"r","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"我没有为你们辩护。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"她依然是个欺诈之徒，你们公然到船厂门前宣讲已经扰乱了船厂的秩序。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"不把她带回去，还留在这里干什么？","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"我就是为了这件事想找您帮忙……","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":116},{"type":"dialog","id":117},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":118},{"type":"charslot","id":119},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_bg_74_g3_seasidest_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":120},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":121},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":122,"musicid":2},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2275_1#1$1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"洒脱的船工","text":"审判庭的人竟然真的放过你了？","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#3$1","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"呼——我、我早就跟你们说过，我可是王室海军后裔，只要成为我的拥护者，我也能庇护你们。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ad/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2275_1#1$1","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"洒脱的船工","text":"拥护……怎么拥护？","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#1$1","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"我一心想要重新组建王室海军舰队，现在还在漫漫征途之中。只不过，筹备舰队需要资金……","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2275_1#1$1","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"洒脱的船工","text":"百年以前，领民确实需要向贵族缴纳税金，可现在我们没这么多钱……","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#10$1","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"不用非得是钱，哪怕是一餐饭、一个住所都好。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#5$1","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"等雷亚-伊比利亚打捞完成，我们的舰队从港口正式出航，到时候我们说不定还能骗得……咳，获得更多财富呢！","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":138},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":139},{"type":"charslot","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":142},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_bg_74_g8_shipatelier.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":143},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"我跟她相识数月，她一直靠骗人、讲故事维生。我受过重伤，没有务工能力，没有她接济怕是早就饿死了。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"话虽如此，我也不能看着一个年轻人一再犯错。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"她的记性很好，也很乐于跟人打交道，走过的路又多，她的脑子里都快有一张自己画的伊比利亚地图了。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"r","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"地图？","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"是啊，而且不仅是现在的伊比利亚的地图。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"她和那些流离失所的人交谈，记住他们的故事和他们的家乡被海水淹没前的位置。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"她所记住的东西里，有伊比利亚本应有的样子。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"等到雷亚-伊比利亚中心城区升起，我们或许需要打捞更多沉没的城镇，既然如此……","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"r","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"她会十分适合在船厂工作。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"她很早就被家人抛弃，又出于一些特殊原因没办法从事体力劳动。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"如果伊比利亚的未来跟即将升起的中心城区一样光明，那她是否也不用再以欺诈为生……","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"r","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"你想要让她生活得更有尊严？","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"伊比利亚人本应具有崇高的德行，这一点也是您所相信的，对吗？","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"r","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"……我明白了。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"虽然你们曾实实在在地干扰了审判庭的事务，但这个城区会再给你们一次机会。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"来船厂报到吧，我们用得上她。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2270_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":171},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":172},{"type":"charslot","id":173},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_bg_74_g3_seasidest_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":176},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":178},{"type":"text","text":"船厂外，人越聚越多，起初人们只是被这里发生的口角和黎博利洪亮的声音吸引，想要一探究竟——","id":179},{"type":"text","text":"却没想到自己会沉迷于一个小姑娘所说的故事。","id":180},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#1$1","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"那边那个制帆匠，你说自己来自金浪湾的金浪城？","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制帆匠","text":"一个终年浓雾笼罩的肮脏小城，城里的教士说城名是罪孽的由来。鳞获不丰，粮食不长，都是名字的错，现在它改名为无浪城啦。","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#12$1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"可惜啊，在我祖辈的描述中，那里的建筑都是白色的，因为无需染料，夕阳自会给它们镀金，居民也都是捕鳞的好手。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#5$1","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"不过，那不是因为他们对鳞群习性多么了解，而是因为他们捕鳞的范围比任何城镇都广。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"虽然每次捕鳞，他们的船只都离岸很远，但他们不怕。因为他们知道，只要在天黑前回望，建筑的金光总能为他们指路。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制帆匠","text":"还有这种说法……？","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#5$1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"当然！而且金浪城还诞生过不少因航海和制帆技术高超而封官加爵的能人，听说他们的子嗣依旧留在城中，只是对祖先的身份不自知……","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制帆匠","text":"我确实比邻居更擅长针线……难道……","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#11$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"正好，德·托莱多大人正在筹备海军舰队，我缺的就是制帆匠，你说巧不巧？说不定我们的祖辈还在王室海军舰队中见过呢！","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制帆匠","text":"好，好！","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#3$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"（做口型）瓦列里奥！瓦列里奥快看！我又找到一个拥护者啦，今天的晚饭有着落啦！","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ad/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#11$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"……","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_2266_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":204},{"type":"dialog","id":205},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":206},{"type":"charslot","id":207},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":208},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":209},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":210},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":211,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2273_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":213},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"r","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的岛民","text":"今天这条街怎么聚集了那么多人？正好，能为我们的行动打掩护。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的岛民","text":"阿奎拉，你来晚了。早上有你的工作安排吗？怎么看上去像刚下过水。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"没什么，去处理了一点私事。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"东西送到了？它对几天后的行动很重要。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"r","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的岛民","text":"放心吧，惩戒军盯不过来。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"charslot","id":224},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_461_1#1$1","duration":"0.8","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","id":226},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","duration":"0.8","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"350,0","id":228},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":229},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":230},{"type":"charslot","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2273_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"……","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"换一条路。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"r","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的岛民","text":"运输活鳞用的旧管道？那条路只有同胞才知道。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"l","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"走。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":240},{"type":"dialog","id":241},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":242},{"type":"charslot","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":244},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_bg_bg_ibindoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":245},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":246},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorclosequite","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":248},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_doorknob","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":251},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#11$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"……不好。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"岛民才知道的路也不一定安全啊，毕竟不是所有岛民都是危险分子，不是吗？","id":256},{"type":"dialog","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2273_1#1$1","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","duration":"0.3","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.6","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":260},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_handknf","id":261},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":262},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2273_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的岛民","text":"嘶……","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-60","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":267},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","id":268},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#8$1","duration":"0.5","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":272},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"又是你！","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"我之前真的多余把你当同胞看待。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":277},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"l","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"你不也辜负了同胞的心意，那个叫纳乔的孩子，他根本不擅长说谎，你倒是没想过牵连他。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"……","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"老实点，你想做什么？","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"把这个带给纳乔。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"螺栓？","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"他的手伤不能再拖了。呵，替伊比利亚人干活，把自己搞成现在这副样子。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"……","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":293},{"type":"charslot","id":294},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_armour","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2277_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":297},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2277_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"德鲁莎教官，我记得提醒过你，最好不要再擅自行动。","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":301},{"type":"charslot","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"行动组？来得真快……你们也盯上了阿奎拉？","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":305},{"type":"charslot","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2277_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"无可奉告。接下来会由我们负责后续的讯问，请你继续巡逻组的工作。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"把人铐上，带走。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":311},{"type":"charslot","id":312},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_handcuff","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","id":315},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":316},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_armour","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":318},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":319},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#9$1","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"……","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":323},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":324},{"type":"charslot","id":325},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":326},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_bg_74_g10_underseacorr.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":327},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":328},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":329},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":330},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":331},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1","duration":"0.5","id":332},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"哈……哈……","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"为什么……阿奎拉还是……","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","duration":"0.8","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"100,0","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#2$1","duration":"0.3","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-50,0","id":339},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":340},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"15","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":341},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement_heavy2","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","duration":"0.5","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"0,0","id":343},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","duration":"0.5","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"0,0","id":344},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":345},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"你是技术工纳乔？","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"塔西塔小姐，克莱门莎监事在吗！我有急事要找她，阿奎拉被审判庭的人带走了！","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"阿奎拉被捕了？克莱门莎监事现在不在，你先……不要着急，我会尽快联系她。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"还有，你的手臂状态看上去很糟糕，我先帮你处理一下？","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"纳乔？","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2268_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"不在？","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":356},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","id":357},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"charslot","id":359},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":360},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","id":361},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"纳乔，无论你是否认同我的想法，作为朋友我只托付你一件事。","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"万一之后几天我出了什么事，你可以去互助会所在的教堂找我们的导师，他会帮我。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#5$1","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"在此之前做你最擅长的事，什么都不要问也不要说。","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":367},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":368},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"charslot","id":370},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#10$1","id":372},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"互助会……","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":376},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":377},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"1.5","id":378},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":379},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2268_1#5$1","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"0.5","id":382},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔西塔","text":"欸，别走啊！","id":384},{"type":"dialog","id":385},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":386},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":387},{"type":"bgeffect","id":388},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":389},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":390},{"type":"image","id":391},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":392}],"characters":["洒脱的船工","特菲","萨尔瓦多","南多","瓦列里奥","？？？","斐戴拉","制帆匠","谨慎的岛民","阿奎拉","德鲁莎","惩戒军士官","纳乔","塔西塔"]}